      "content": "hey, i have a history of kidney stones (calcium oxalate ones) and i've been feeling pretty sluggish lately. i was thinking about starting a heavy vitamin c regimen to boost my immune system and \"cleanse\" my kidneys out. is it okay if i take like 2500mg or 3000mg a day? i feel like more is better for detoxing.",
